  "body": "Release notes can be found [on GitHub](https://github.com/projectcalico/calico/blob/release-v3.33/release-notes/v3.33.0-release-notes.md)\r\n\r\nAttached to this release are the following artifacts:\r\n\r\n- `release-v3.33.0.tgz`: container images, binaries, and kubernetes manifests.\r\n- `calico-windows-v3.33.0.zip`: Calico for Windows.\r\n- `tigera-operator-v3.33.0.tgz`: Calico Helm 3 chart (also hosted at oci://quay.io/calico/charts/tigera-operator).\r\n- `crd.projectcalico.org.v1-v3.33.0.tgz`: Calico crd.projectcalico.org/v1 CRD chart.\r\n- `projectcalico.org.v3-v3.33.0.tgz`: Calico projectcalico.org/v3 CRD chart (tech-preview).\r\n- ocp.tgz: Manifest bundle for OpenShift.\r\n\r\nAdditional links:\r\n\r\n- [VPP data plane release information](https://github.com/projectcalico/vpp-dataplane/blob/master/RELEASE_NOTES.md)\r\n\r\n",
